"on .5 degree meridians). Boulder CO: National Center for Atmospheric "
"Research. <a href=\"http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/ecosys/cdroms/ged_iia/datasets/"
"a04/lw.htm\">http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/ecosys/cdroms/ged_iia/datasets/a04/lw."
"htm</a></li><li>CRU CL 2.0: New, M., Lister, D., Hulme, M. and Makin, I., "
"2002: A high-resolution data set of surface climate over global land areas. "
"Climate Research 21.<a href=\"http://www.cru.uea.ac.uk/cru/data/hrg\">http://"
"www.cru.uea.ac.uk/cru/data/hrg</a></li></ul></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><i>Mapas de temperatura e precipitacións (xullo e decembro)</"
"i><br>Combinación de dous xogos de datos:<ul><li>Legates, D.R. e Willmott, C."
"J. 1989. Temperatura media mensual do aire superficial e precipitación. "
"Datos de rastrexado dixital nunha grella de 0,5 graos xeográficos (lat/lon) "
"361x721 (rexistrado centroide en meridianos de 0,5 graos). Boulder CO: "
"National Center for Atmospheric Research. <a href=\"http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/"
"ecosys/cdroms/ged_iia/datasets/a04/lw.htm\">http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/ecosys/"
"cdroms/ged_iia/datasets/a04/lw.htm</a></li><li>CRU CL 2.0: New, M., Lister, "
"D., Hulme, M. and Makin, I., 2002: Conxulto de datos de alta resolución "
"sobre o clima superficial sobre áreas de terra globais. Climate Research 21."
"<a href=\"http://www.cru.uea.ac.uk/cru/data/hrg\">http://www.cru.uea.ac.uk/"
"cru/data/hrg</a></li></ul></p>"

